<title>USA: Casino Resource sells Miss. casino stake.</title>
<headline>Casino Resource sells Miss. casino stake.</headline>
<dateline>BILOXI, Miss. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Casino Resource Corp Thursday said it has sold its 20 percent interest in New Palace Casino LLC to its joint venture partners, Robert and Lawana Low, who own eighty-percent.</p>
<p>Casino Resource will receive $1.0 million in cash and a note for $250,000 due on January 31, 1999, for the stake. CRC also will receive a return of all moneys expended by CRC on behalf of the LLC.</p>
<p>CRC and the Lows closed the transaction purchasing the Palace on January 31, 1997.</p>
</text>
